---
import PrimaryButton from '../../global/PrimaryButton.astro';
---
<section class="section-philosophy">
  <div class="section-gap">
    <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-main w-container">
      <div class="philosophy-wrapper">
        <div scroll="scroll interaction" class="philosophy-left-wrapper">
          <div class="philosophy-details-block">
            <p class="philosophy-details-text"><span class="philosophy-text">My Philosophy</span> I firmly believe that true growth is not solely a product of motivation. Instead, it emerges when a clear vision aligns with decisive action. This synergy between understanding what we want and taking the necessary steps to achieve it is what truly propels us forward.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="philosophy-details-bottom">
            <div class="philosophy-details-inner">
              <p class="body-text-main">I believe in providing personalized guidance rather than generic advice. Each strategy I develop is meticulously crafted to align with your unique circumstances, aspirations, and individual strengths, ensuring that it resonates with your specific needs.</p>
              <div class="philosophy-button-block">
                <PrimaryButton href="/contact" text="Let’s Collaborate" />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div scroll="scroll interaction" class="philosophy-content-right">
          <div class="philosophy-image-block"><img src="/images/philosophy-image.webp" loading="lazy" alt="philosophy-image" class="philosophy-image"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
